{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-22914","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-23251","text":"PULSE × box-and-box — Arithmetic Integration Review"}]},{"id":"blk-22915","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-23252","marks":["bold"],"text":"Status:"},{"id":"spn-23253","text":" review (no schema break) · "},{"id":"spn-23254","marks":["bold"],"text":"Kernel:"},{"id":"spn-23255","text":" "},{"id":"spn-23256","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box"},{"id":"spn-23257","text":" v0.8.0 (8 rungs, 97 laws) "},{"id":"spn-23258","marks":["bold"],"text":"Scope:"},{"id":"spn-23259","text":" how the PULSE loop-manifest standard (OS-010) relates to the [&] governance kernel, what already aligns, and what additive wiring is available."}]},{"id":"blk-22916","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-23260","text":"TL;DR"}]},{"id":"blk-22917","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-23261","text":"PULSE and box-and-box are "},{"id":"spn-23262","marks":["bold"],"text":"orthogonal and complementary"},{"id":"spn-23263","text":". PULSE "},{"id":"spn-23264","marks":["italic"],"text":"sequences a loop over time"},{"id":"spn-23265","text":" (phases, cadence, substrates, cross-loop signals). box-and-box renders a "},{"id":"spn-23266","marks":["bold"],"text":"single-decision verdict"},{"id":"spn-23267","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-23268","marks":["code"],"text":"feasible ▸ permitted ▸ best"},{"id":"spn-23269","text":" over an un-weakenable safety floor. The kernel governs "},{"id":"spn-23270","marks":["italic"],"text":"what is allowed to happen at"},{"id":"spn-23271","text":" a PULSE phase; it is not itself a phase or a set of phases. There is "},{"id":"spn-23272","marks":["bold"],"text":"no 1:1 mapping"},{"id":"spn-23273","text":" between the 8 rungs and the 5 phase kinds — do not introduce one."}]},{"id":"blk-22918","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-23274","text":"The integration surface is small and entirely additive:"}]},{"id":"blk-22919","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-22921","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-23275","text":"PULSE's 7 boolean "},{"id":"spn-23276","marks":["code"],"text":"invariants"},{"id":"spn-23277","text":" are the manifest-level shadow of the kernel's alethic"}]}],"id":"blk-22920","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-22922","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-23278","marks":["bold"],"text":"Value families"},{"id":"spn-23279","text":". They can be "},{"id":"spn-23280","marks":["italic"],"text":"checked"},{"id":"spn-23281","text":" by the kernel but the schema needs no change."}]},{"id":"blk-22923","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-22925","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-23282","marks":["code"],"text":"closure.guarantee"},{"id":"spn-23283","text":" is already an LTL fragment — it lines up with the kernel's"}]}],"id":"blk-22924","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":2},{"id":"blk-22926","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-23284","marks":["bold"],"text":"temporal"},{"id":"spn-23285","text":" rung (rung 4) operators."}]},{"id":"blk-22927","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-22929","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-23286","text":"PULSE V0.2's proposed linear/affine token typing is the kernel's "},{"id":"spn-23287","marks":["bold"],"text":"resource"},{"id":"spn-23288","text":" rung"}]}],"id":"blk-22928","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":3},{"id":"blk-22930","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-23289","text":"(rung 8, the affine ledger) viewed at the manifest layer."}]},{"id":"blk-22931","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-22933","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-23290","text":"A loop "},{"id":"spn-23291","marks":["italic"],"text":"may"},{"id":"spn-23292","text":" declare a phase whose body is \"run the kernel verdict\" — but PULSE does not"}]}],"id":"blk-22932","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":4},{"id":"blk-22934","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-23293","text":"need a new phase "},{"id":"spn-23294","marks":["code"],"text":"kind"},{"id":"spn-23295","text":" to express this; it is an ordinary "},{"id":"spn-23296","marks":["code"],"text":"act"},{"id":"spn-23297","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-23298","marks":["code"],"text":"route"},{"id":"spn-23299","text":" phase."}]},{"id":"blk-22935","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-23300","text":"Rung-by-rung alignment"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-22937","spans":[{"id":"spn-23301","text":"Kernel rung"}]},{"id":"blk-22938","spans":[{"id":"spn-23302","text":"PULSE construct that already carries it"}]},{"id":"blk-22939","spans":[{"id":"spn-23303","text":"Already aligned?"}]}],"id":"blk-22936","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-22940","spans":[{"id":"spn-23304","text":"1. alethic ("},{"id":"spn-23305","marks":["code"],"text":"value"},{"id":"spn-23306","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-22941","spans":[{"id":"spn-23307","marks":["code"],"text":"invariants"},{"id":"spn-23308","text":" booleans (π/κ/β/σ families); "},{"id":"spn-23309","marks":["code"],"text":"phase.kind"},{"id":"spn-23310","text":" enumerates what "},{"id":"spn-23311","marks":["italic"],"text":"can"},{"id":"spn-23312","text":" happen"}]},{"id":"blk-22942","spans":[{"id":"spn-23313","text":"✅ at manifest level"}]}],[{"id":"blk-22943","spans":[{"id":"spn-23314","text":"2. axiological ("},{"id":"spn-23315","marks":["code"],"text":"score"},{"id":"spn-23316","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-22944","spans":[{"id":"spn-23317","text":"— (PULSE does not rank; PRISM does)"}]},{"id":"blk-22945","spans":[{"id":"spn-23318","text":"n/a — lives in PRISM"}]}],[{"id":"blk-22946","spans":[{"id":"spn-23319","text":"3. deontic (norm/govern)"}]},{"id":"blk-22947","spans":[{"id":"spn-23320","marks":["code"],"text":"substrates.policy"},{"id":"spn-23321","text":", "},{"id":"spn-23322","marks":["code"],"text":"substrates.audit"},{"id":"spn-23323","text":"; "},{"id":"spn-23324","marks":["code"],"text":"quorum_before_commit"}]},{"id":"blk-22948","spans":[{"id":"spn-23325","text":"◻ partial — declared, not enforced by 